#~ "# The package map\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "pantoken is a monorepo of small, single-purpose packages grouped into "
#~ "buckets. Install the one that\n"
#~ "fits your task, or install the unified `pantoken` package and import from "
#~ "its subpaths (for example\n"
#~ "`pantoken/css`, `pantoken/react`, `pantoken/tailwind`).\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "## Core\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "The shared model and the transformer everything else builds on.\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "| Package                                                 | What it "
#~ "does                                                                                                       "
#~ "|\n"
#~ "| ------------------------------------------------------- | "
#~ "------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ "
#~ "|\n"
#~ "| [`@pantoken/model`](/api/packages/model/src/)           | Zero-"
#~ "dependency TypeScript types: the `Token` shape and the plugin "
#~ "contract.                                       |\n"
#~ "| [`@pantoken/core`](/api/packages/core/src/)             | Resolves the "
#~ "upstream tokens and icons into the canonical IR, and renders "
#~ "CSS.                                     |\n"
#~ "| [`@pantoken/tokens`](/api/formats/tokens/src/)          | The resolved "
#~ "IR vendored as static JSON, per theme, plus the raw Tokens Studio "
#~ "source.                             |\n"
#~ "| [`@pantoken/utils`](/api/packages/utils/src/)           | The token "
#~ "resolver, reference regexes, case and color helpers, drift checks, and "
#~ "the token→utility-class emitters. |\n"
#~ "| [`@pantoken/plugin-kit`](/api/packages/plugin-kit/src/) | Build and "
#~ "compose pantoken plugins with "
#~ "`definePlugin`.                                                            "
#~ "|\n"
#~ "| [`@pantoken/cli`](/api/packages/cli/src/)               | `pantoken "
